(1706835, 229564, 3669, '<td valign="top">First when this photo popped up on the screen, I was thinking that the colors were not bold enough.  However, after I''ve looked at it for awhile, I really like softer color.  Goes well with the stark white background.  Has the shape of a baby''s bottom.  I like the light reflections...not too harsh.  Very good work.  I see a winner here.  10</td>', 'First when this photo popped up on the screen, I was thinking that the colors were not bold enough.  However, after I''ve looked at it for awhile, I really like softer color.  Goes well with the stark white background.  Has the shape of a baby''s bottom.  I like the light reflections...not too harsh.  Very good work.  I see a winner here.  10', '2005-09-14 02:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1706842, 230912, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice lines.  Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Nice lines.  Interesting perspective.', '2005-09-14 02:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1706853, 231288, 36956, '<td valign="top">o wow, a stunning shot, def my favorite so far... nicely done, everything is perfect in my opinion</td>', 'o wow, a stunning shot, def my favorite so far... nicely done, everything is perfect in my opinion', '2005-09-14 02:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1706863, 230432, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  The white border is very distracting.  Looks like you may have a hot pixel (2nd pawn on the left).  I''m getting a little bored of photos with chess pieces, but this one is nice...just don''t put white borders around dark pictures again.  :-)</td>', 'Nice lighting.  The white border is very distracting.  Looks like you may have a hot pixel (2nd pawn on the left).  I''m getting a little bored of photos with chess pieces, but this one is nice...just don''t put white borders around dark pictures again.  :-)', '2005-09-14 02:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1706874, 229586, 3669, '<td valign="top">Could use more contrast.  Would have liked to see this in color, I think.</td>', 'Could use more contrast.  Would have liked to see this in color, I think.', '2005-09-14 02:51:02.000000', NULL, 1);
