(1707096, 231178, 3669, '<td valign="top">Kudos for creativity.  I know this sounds real picky, but I think I would have liked to see the chimney inside the top of the middle triangle.  Also cropping the picture where the outside edges would be even with the clover shapes would make it more uniform.  In any event, perhaps I''m just being a little anal.  :-)  All in all, I like the idea of using the gate ornamentation to frame your picture.  I like the colors and the foilage.</td>', 'Kudos for creativity.  I know this sounds real picky, but I think I would have liked to see the chimney inside the top of the middle triangle.  Also cropping the picture where the outside edges would be even with the clover shapes would make it more uniform.  In any event, perhaps I''m just being a little anal.  :-)  All in all, I like the idea of using the gate ornamentation to frame your picture.  I like the colors and the foilage.', '2005-09-14 04:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707098, 228540, 29474, '<td valign="top">I''d comment on this if I could remember what you call that thing on a cock''s head!!! It should all be in the picture.</td>', 'I''d comment on this if I could remember what you call that thing on a cock''s head!!! It should all be in the picture.', '2005-09-14 04:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
