(1707658, 228902, 4477, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to figure this out..ha  Very interesting perspective...  I like that it''s in B&amp;W, but is a bit too grainy.</td>', 'Took me a while to figure this out..ha  Very interesting perspective...  I like that it''s in B&W, but is a bit too grainy.', '2005-09-14 09:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707661, 230418, 4477, '<td valign="top">I hope this ribbons!  Such beautiful colors, and the compositon can''t be perfected.  A favorite for me!</td>', 'I hope this ribbons!  Such beautiful colors, and the compositon can''t be perfected.  A favorite for me!', '2005-09-14 09:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707664, 229960, 4477, '<td valign="top">I like the subject matter, and the attempt...  I''m sure the longer shutter speed blurred it a bit.</td>', 'I like the subject matter, and the attempt...  I''m sure the longer shutter speed blurred it a bit.', '2005-09-14 09:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707682, 230621, 4477, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this POV works for the photo.  The focus draws the viewer''s eyes too far down into the corner of the photo too.  Great tones.</td>', 'Not sure if this POV works for the photo.  The focus draws the viewer''s eyes too far down into the corner of the photo too.  Great tones.', '2005-09-14 09:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707694, 229777, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line.  The sky and water reflection is a tad "hot" but the overall composition is good.  Maybe working on curves a bit might help this photo along.</td>', 'Nice leading line.  The sky and water reflection is a tad "hot" but the overall composition is good.  Maybe working on curves a bit might help this photo along.', '2005-09-14 09:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707704, 228900, 27991, '<td valign="top">brilliant color on the sky. Nice clean lines.</td>', 'brilliant color on the sky. Nice clean lines.', '2005-09-14 09:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707705, 231084, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. Best I''ve seen of the challenge so far. The green and blue are wonderful compliments to each other. The rope and grid of the metal with the soldiering pattern of the bricks over the opening make  for wonderful textural differences. I like the dim light - to showcase what appears to be neon. The gothic arch point your eye up to the upper areas of the photo.  10</td>', 'This is excellent. Best I''ve seen of the challenge so far. The green and blue are wonderful compliments to each other. The rope and grid of the metal with the soldiering pattern of the bricks over the opening make  for wonderful textural differences. I like the dim light - to showcase what appears to be neon. The gothic arch point your eye up to the upper areas of the photo.  10', '2005-09-14 09:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707706, 231169, 27991, '<td valign="top">black and white works well with this. nice and sharp</td>', 'black and white works well with this. nice and sharp', '2005-09-14 09:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707707, 231010, 43502, '<td valign="top">Maaaan imagine this shot if you would cut it in half where the black line is ...would be almost perfect but i really like it ... You don''t need the bottom reflection</td>', 'Maaaan imagine this shot if you would cut it in half where the black line is ...would be almost perfect but i really like it ... You don''t need the bottom reflection', '2005-09-14 09:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707708, 228660, 15711, '<td valign="top">How imaginative.  I like this alot.  It appears to be a woman''s hipline swaying from side to side. This is the most clever shot I''ve seen in a long time.  The small bit of color on the chain belt make for a bit of punch amidst the dim tones of the wood and the silver. Perfect lighting to highling the curve of the wood. Great detailing and the focus is dead clear!!! 10</td>', 'How imaginative.  I like this alot.  It appears to be a woman''s hipline swaying from side to side. This is the most clever shot I''ve seen in a long time.  The small bit of color on the chain belt make for a bit of punch amidst the dim tones of the wood and the silver. Perfect lighting to highling the curve of the wood. Great detailing and the focus is dead clear!!! 10', '2005-09-14 09:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707711, 229968, 27991, '<td valign="top">Even though its called reflections.. the reflections on the top are a bit distracting. The fish seeing himself on the side only would have made the picture a better view i think. 6</td>', 'Even though its called reflections.. the reflections on the top are a bit distracting. The fish seeing himself on the side only would have made the picture a better view i think. 6', '2005-09-14 09:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707712, 231250, 27991, '<td valign="top">nice job.. makes it look ten stories high.7</td>', 'nice job.. makes it look ten stories high.7', '2005-09-14 09:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707713, 228885, 27991, '<td valign="top">imaginative.6</td>', 'imaginative.6', '2005-09-14 09:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707714, 228596, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the single word title.  The infrared of the trees is cool against the warm gold sky and brown of the street. I like that the sign is leaning - it adds a touch of variation to the symmetry of the lined trees. I also like the tree on the far right side, being curved ever so slightly like it''s trying to sneak out of the shot. The composition of this is really well done. The bench helps to ground the shot. Imaginative.</td>', 'I like the single word title.  The infrared of the trees is cool against the warm gold sky and brown of the street. I like that the sign is leaning - it adds a touch of variation to the symmetry of the lined trees. I also like the tree on the far right side, being curved ever so slightly like it''s trying to sneak out of the shot. The composition of this is really well done. The bench helps to ground the shot. Imaginative.', '2005-09-14 09:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707717, 229165, 27991, '<td valign="top">this would make a wonderful print. black and white has always been a favorite of mine. The fog in the distance really plays on this. 9</td>', 'this would make a wonderful print. black and white has always been a favorite of mine. The fog in the distance really plays on this. 9', '2005-09-14 09:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707720, 231352, 15711, '<td valign="top">That IS a knife.  The clarity is there but I don''t sense any reflective quality which might have made this a really spectacular shot. The wrinkling of the blue fabric in the back is a tad distracting. I think a solid flat backdrop might have served you better.</td>', 'That IS a knife.  The clarity is there but I don''t sense any reflective quality which might have made this a really spectacular shot. The wrinkling of the blue fabric in the back is a tad distracting. I think a solid flat backdrop might have served you better.', '2005-09-14 09:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707723, 230171, 15711, '<td valign="top">CLEVER.  I love it when someone finds a living action (or appearance thereof) of an inanimate object.  I''m hoping you are thinking the two holes at the bottom are eyes? Not the most interesting photo, but your ability to see something other than what it is, peaks my appreciation and I''m voting accordingly.</td>', 'CLEVER.  I love it when someone finds a living action (or appearance thereof) of an inanimate object.  I''m hoping you are thinking the two holes at the bottom are eyes? Not the most interesting photo, but your ability to see something other than what it is, peaks my appreciation and I''m voting accordingly.', '2005-09-14 09:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707724, 230995, 27991, '<td valign="top">I think the grass is a bit much in the dogs face. you can barely see his expression. Good concept just fair execution of it. 4</td>', 'I think the grass is a bit much in the dogs face. you can barely see his expression. Good concept just fair execution of it. 4', '2005-09-14 09:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707727, 230991, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. This evokes a sense of calm. I like the yellow greens against the blue of the water and sky. I wish this image were larger - I''d like to study the details of the rock wall. One sheep , cow or horse would really make this a perfect shot for me. Nice!</td>', 'Very pretty. This evokes a sense of calm. I like the yellow greens against the blue of the water and sky. I wish this image were larger - I''d like to study the details of the rock wall. One sheep , cow or horse would really make this a perfect shot for me. Nice!', '2005-09-14 09:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707730, 230349, 27991, '<td valign="top">im actually getting dizzy just moving my eyes about this picture. Nice job. you captured your title perfectly.7</td>', 'im actually getting dizzy just moving my eyes about this picture. Nice job. you captured your title perfectly.7', '2005-09-14 09:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707731, 230827, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great title. Nice use of lighting. I like the reflection of the yellow arrow.  The landscape presentation gives the horizontal sense of it an interesting twist.</td>', 'Great title. Nice use of lighting. I like the reflection of the yellow arrow.  The landscape presentation gives the horizontal sense of it an interesting twist.', '2005-09-14 09:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707733, 229726, 15711, '<td valign="top">This would be great if you really punched up the contrast ALOT. AS it is, it just kind of stays in the midrange of grays and isn''t overly interesting. I''m not certain of the meaning of the title, but I"m sure it is significant to you.</td>', 'This would be great if you really punched up the contrast ALOT. AS it is, it just kind of stays in the midrange of grays and isn''t overly interesting. I''m not certain of the meaning of the title, but I"m sure it is significant to you.', '2005-09-14 09:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707736, 230012, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks like George Washington.  I like the landscape presentation. The shadowing works well. What if you upped the contrast even more?  Hmmm just a thought.</td>', 'Looks like George Washington.  I like the landscape presentation. The shadowing works well. What if you upped the contrast even more?  Hmmm just a thought.', '2005-09-14 09:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
