(1707767, 230763, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the sense of movement.  This is really interesting.  I feel my hair blowing back!!!  Nicely done and not expected.</td>', 'I love the sense of movement.  This is really interesting.  I feel my hair blowing back!!!  Nicely done and not expected.', '2005-09-14 10:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
