(1707784, 231141, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty setting. The reflection of the stone pillars are nice in the water.  I''d love even more contrast to really give it extra punch.  Nice leading lines.  Where is this?</td>', 'Pretty setting. The reflection of the stone pillars are nice in the water.  I''d love even more contrast to really give it extra punch.  Nice leading lines.  Where is this?', '2005-09-14 10:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
