(1707791, 230948, 15711, '<td valign="top">That is hilarious.  Love the whiskers.  Not sure if it''s the best example for perspective, but at least it adds some humor to my cday.  THANKS!</td>', 'That is hilarious.  Love the whiskers.  Not sure if it''s the best example for perspective, but at least it adds some humor to my cday.  THANKS!', '2005-09-14 10:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
