(1707806, 230286, 15711, '<td valign="top">COOL!!!! Perfect for the challenge.  That  bit of gray on the left of the mirror slightly diminishes the perfect reflection of the mountain and sky. Imaginative and clever though. 7</td>', 'COOL!!!! Perfect for the challenge.  That  bit of gray on the left of the mirror slightly diminishes the perfect reflection of the mountain and sky. Imaginative and clever though. 7', '2005-09-14 10:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
