(1707815, 230870, 15711, '<td valign="top">That single touch of red is nice. The crouched position of the child almost mimics the shape of the pier.  I like the reflection.  The sun is a tad "hot" in it''s shimmer on the water, but I really like the composition and idea alot.</td>', 'That single touch of red is nice. The crouched position of the child almost mimics the shape of the pier.  I like the reflection.  The sun is a tad "hot" in it''s shimmer on the water, but I really like the composition and idea alot.', '2005-09-14 10:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707817, 230682, 4477, '<td valign="top">I''ve always liked church photos like this.  I like the use of lighting, though it is a bit overexposed on the right side just a tiny bit.  Good job though!</td>', 'I''ve always liked church photos like this.  I like the use of lighting, though it is a bit overexposed on the right side just a tiny bit.  Good job though!', '2005-09-14 10:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707820, 230570, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  What a fun shot.  I like it very much.  THe placement of the basket in the shot works well for the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Great colors!  What a fun shot.  I like it very much.  THe placement of the basket in the shot works well for the rule of thirds.', '2005-09-14 10:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707823, 230507, 38925, '<td valign="top">amazing lighting</td>', 'amazing lighting', '2005-09-14 10:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707824, 230995, 40977, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, I think the dog is a bit OOF and the image is also a bit grainy.  However, a true perspective.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like the idea, I think the dog is a bit OOF and the image is also a bit grainy.  However, a true perspective.  Nice job.', '2005-09-14 10:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707826, 229269, 40977, '<td valign="top">Such a great idea and the colors are so vivid.   A Really nice job.</td>', 'Such a great idea and the colors are so vivid.   A Really nice job.', '2005-09-14 10:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707828, 231071, 4477, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I like how you composed this shot...</td>', 'Beautiful!  I like how you composed this shot...', '2005-09-14 10:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707829, 230571, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the pigeon in flight!!  If it were perfect for my eye, I''d crop out the peaks of the building on the right. Great silhouette.</td>', 'Love the pigeon in flight!!  If it were perfect for my eye, I''d crop out the peaks of the building on the right. Great silhouette.', '2005-09-14 10:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707830, 230590, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love one word titles.  The figure walking up the brick sidewalk grounds the shot and gives us a point of reference.</td>', 'I love one word titles.  The figure walking up the brick sidewalk grounds the shot and gives us a point of reference.', '2005-09-14 10:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707832, 230711, 40977, '<td valign="top">Your title really helps with the imagery...right or wrong I might have scored it differently,not knowing what you saw for this shot.  Nice job.</td>', 'Your title really helps with the imagery...right or wrong I might have scored it differently,not knowing what you saw for this shot.  Nice job.', '2005-09-14 10:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
