(1708161, 230876, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.  Would have liked a brighter image, especially in the sky.  I also see some spotting in the sky.  When I have this problem, it is usually because my focus was off when I took the photo.  Adjustments to settings include exposure compensation being + 1 or so, tripod, and maybe a different time of day.</td>', 'Very dramatic.  Would have liked a brighter image, especially in the sky.  I also see some spotting in the sky.  When I have this problem, it is usually because my focus was off when I took the photo.  Adjustments to settings include exposure compensation being + 1 or so, tripod, and maybe a different time of day.', '2005-09-14 11:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
