(1708199, 230274, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I would have liked a cleaner focus.  If you had focused on the point in advance, then taken the picture, the disc would have been clearer and added a really nice perspective to the photo.  I don''t have as much of an issue with the out of focus person as I do with the disc.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I would have liked a cleaner focus.  If you had focused on the point in advance, then taken the picture, the disc would have been clearer and added a really nice perspective to the photo.  I don''t have as much of an issue with the out of focus person as I do with the disc.', '2005-09-14 11:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
