(1708231, 229856, 40386, '<td valign="top">Great colors and angle, love the idea but am not sure if I like the horse being soft while the rest is sharp, although it does make the horse/driver stand out from a busy picture, kinda like having the scenario of the background out of focust and the horse and driver sharp but the opposite?</td>', 'Great colors and angle, love the idea but am not sure if I like the horse being soft while the rest is sharp, although it does make the horse/driver stand out from a busy picture, kinda like having the scenario of the background out of focust and the horse and driver sharp but the opposite?', '2005-09-14 12:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
