(1709142, 230711, 43031, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, I like the endpoint off center like that. Haze at the end give a good sense of distance, but might be a tad washed out when compared to the rest.</td>', 'Nice colors, I like the endpoint off center like that. Haze at the end give a good sense of distance, but might be a tad washed out when compared to the rest.', '2005-09-14 19:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
