(1709162, 230550, 42714, '<td valign="top">This just seems to suffer from too much light filtering through, and not enough focus.  Would recommend using a tripod and playing with your settings to get a better lighting condition.  Your foliage will turn out all the better for it. :)</td>', 'This just seems to suffer from too much light filtering through, and not enough focus.  Would recommend using a tripod and playing with your settings to get a better lighting condition.  Your foliage will turn out all the better for it. :)', '2005-09-14 19:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
