(1709249, 229090, 3554, '<td valign="top">Not enough "scurry" in the background to pull off the title. I like the concept but I''m not sure the particular angle you chose really works for this. I think if you wanted her out of focus you probably needed more of the bench in the foreground in focus so there was a lot of contrast.</td>', 'Not enough "scurry" in the background to pull off the title. I like the concept but I''m not sure the particular angle you chose really works for this. I think if you wanted her out of focus you probably needed more of the bench in the foreground in focus so there was a lot of contrast.', '2005-09-14 20:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
