(1711055, 231244, 42714, '<td valign="top">Whatever that is on the right (looks like a trash bin) whether by flash or sunlight is too just bright and distracting, particularlyin comparison to the rest of the composition.</td>', 'Whatever that is on the right (looks like a trash bin) whether by flash or sunlight is too just bright and distracting, particularlyin comparison to the rest of the composition.', '2005-09-15 09:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711061, 231247, 11738, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image but the compression artifacts are very, very apparent.  Image treatment colour is also a bit off.  Almost looks like the photo was grunged or something.  I do however like the sky gradient from upper right to lower left.</td>', 'This is an interesting image but the compression artifacts are very, very apparent.  Image treatment colour is also a bit off.  Almost looks like the photo was grunged or something.  I do however like the sky gradient from upper right to lower left.', '2005-09-15 09:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711062, 229806, 42638, '<td valign="top">Love the yellow flowers against the background. Interesting perspective by not as strong as it could be. maybe focus in on a flower differently with others fading out and away. Its hard to tell if that is a bee close up or a plane far away.</td>', 'Love the yellow flowers against the background. Interesting perspective by not as strong as it could be. maybe focus in on a flower differently with others fading out and away. Its hard to tell if that is a bee close up or a plane far away.', '2005-09-15 09:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711064, 230788, 11738, '<td valign="top">Now this is a cool perspective shot.  I''m glad your sky had those clouds.  Adds to the overall effect of the image.  I just wish the red on the tower wasn''t as muted, but not reducing score because of this.  Good work.</td>', 'Now this is a cool perspective shot.  I''m glad your sky had those clouds.  Adds to the overall effect of the image.  I just wish the red on the tower wasn''t as muted, but not reducing score because of this.  Good work.', '2005-09-15 09:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711073, 229382, 42638, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting picture. I''m not sure what your goal was for it, it isn''t quickly obvious but  I do see a bit of perspective structure. I sure wish it was stronger. Maybe try to angle the camera a bit instead of a straight on shot.</td>', 'This is an interesting picture. I''m not sure what your goal was for it, it isn''t quickly obvious but  I do see a bit of perspective structure. I sure wish it was stronger. Maybe try to angle the camera a bit instead of a straight on shot.', '2005-09-15 09:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711074, 231233, 35545, '<td valign="top">IMHO *something* in the picture needs to be in focus.</td>', 'IMHO *something* in the picture needs to be in focus.', '2005-09-15 09:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711077, 231058, 35545, '<td valign="top">Neat reflection in the glass, but the tilt really kills this picture for me.</td>', 'Neat reflection in the glass, but the tilt really kills this picture for me.', '2005-09-15 10:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711079, 230894, 42638, '<td valign="top">I am not sure about this one. I can see some perspective features, its just not very strong. The dimension is there, it just doesn''t pop out at you.</td>', 'I am not sure about this one. I can see some perspective features, its just not very strong. The dimension is there, it just doesn''t pop out at you.', '2005-09-15 10:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711083, 228540, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nice capture ot this one. It doesn''t come across as a dramatic perspective but its still a good shot.</td>', 'Nice capture ot this one. It doesn''t come across as a dramatic perspective but its still a good shot.', '2005-09-15 10:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711086, 231018, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really like the color and mood of this picture.  Too bad you have that powerline cutting through it.  I think you could have cropped it out and still gotten the effect.</td>', 'I really like the color and mood of this picture.  Too bad you have that powerline cutting through it.  I think you could have cropped it out and still gotten the effect.', '2005-09-15 10:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711088, 228708, 11738, '<td valign="top">This is totally weird and totally cool.  I''d get that date stamp out of there for future submissions though.  Interesting gradient border.</td>', 'This is totally weird and totally cool.  I''d get that date stamp out of there for future submissions though.  Interesting gradient border.', '2005-09-15 10:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
