(1711092, 229269, 11738, '<td valign="top">They play marbles in hell?  Cool.</td>', 'They play marbles in hell?  Cool.', '2005-09-15 10:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711093, 231067, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Love the flying gravel, too bad you couldn''t get in there close and make it a more integral part of the picture.l</td>', 'Great photo.  Love the flying gravel, too bad you couldn''t get in there close and make it a more integral part of the picture.l', '2005-09-15 10:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711094, 229467, 11738, '<td valign="top">A very intersting image but the lighting isn''t too great.  I think this could have worked very well as B&amp;W with some dodging on the bull and the man to bring out more detail.  As it is now, they are both quite dark and it''s hard to spot details.</td>', 'A very intersting image but the lighting isn''t too great.  I think this could have worked very well as B&W with some dodging on the bull and the man to bring out more detail.  As it is now, they are both quite dark and it''s hard to spot details.', '2005-09-15 10:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711097, 230637, 11738, '<td valign="top">Should have dusted your baby off before the shoot.</td>', 'Should have dusted your baby off before the shoot.', '2005-09-15 10:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711101, 231120, 42638, '<td valign="top">Good picture. Not a strong dramatic perspective but I like it. I can almost hear the sounds.</td>', 'Good picture. Not a strong dramatic perspective but I like it. I can almost hear the sounds.', '2005-09-15 10:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711102, 230986, 11738, '<td valign="top">Freaky image treatment.  Don''t care too much for the treatment.  Sorry. Dumpster / metal thing looks kinda cool.   A comment is a comment, right?</td>', 'Freaky image treatment.  Don''t care too much for the treatment.  Sorry. Dumpster / metal thing looks kinda cool.   A comment is a comment, right?', '2005-09-15 10:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711112, 230094, 42638, '<td valign="top">Good job! I like these flowers all in a row. The background really makes them pop out too. I would have scored you higher but it didn''t come across as dramatic as some of the others out there. Nice picture though.</td>', 'Good job! I like these flowers all in a row. The background really makes them pop out too. I would have scored you higher but it didn''t come across as dramatic as some of the others out there. Nice picture though.', '2005-09-15 10:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711123, 231194, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, I am not sure how you did this but its a neat picture. Love how the color pops this flower right out at you. I might have cropped the top part off a bit. It is a bit distracting. That might strengthen this picture. Good job.</td>', 'Wow, I am not sure how you did this but its a neat picture. Love how the color pops this flower right out at you. I might have cropped the top part off a bit. It is a bit distracting. That might strengthen this picture. Good job.', '2005-09-15 10:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711127, 231161, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Love the color against the sky. I probabily would have cropped that small white cloud off the top and brought it in just a tad. That may have really brought this out more. Good job.</td>', 'Nice picture. Love the color against the sky. I probabily would have cropped that small white cloud off the top and brought it in just a tad. That may have really brought this out more. Good job.', '2005-09-15 10:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
