(1711228, 231339, 42808, '<td valign="top">Cool composition and subject matter and the sky is very effective. It''s a bit over-exposed and noisy in overall quality, but great potential.</td>', 'Cool composition and subject matter and the sky is very effective. It''s a bit over-exposed and noisy in overall quality, but great potential.', '2005-09-15 11:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
