(1712404, 230526, 42837, '<td valign="top">Great use of shallow Depth of Field, but the idea seems too heavily reliant on the title for my taste.  Could be improved by cropping the unnecessary black blur at the top of the shot too.</td>', 'Great use of shallow Depth of Field, but the idea seems too heavily reliant on the title for my taste.  Could be improved by cropping the unnecessary black blur at the top of the shot too.', '2005-09-15 19:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
