(1712435, 230913, 35894, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective, but I find the wire and the building on the left side to be distracting.</td>', 'I like the perspective, but I find the wire and the building on the left side to be distracting.', '2005-09-15 19:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
