(1712496, 230658, 34547, '<td valign="top">...into my favorites! Nice photo. Well centered, deep blacks and a smoothe, cloudless sky with nothing distracting the background.</td>', '...into my favorites! Nice photo. Well centered, deep blacks and a smoothe, cloudless sky with nothing distracting the background.', '2005-09-15 20:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
