(1712522, 231256, 42410, '<td valign="top">Really like the photo. Good perspective. It gives me that lonely homey feeling.</td>', 'Really like the photo. Good perspective. It gives me that lonely homey feeling.', '2005-09-15 20:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
