(1712542, 229266, 42410, '<td valign="top">I think that it is a good idea. The only thing that is distracting is that the lights are way too bright.</td>', 'I think that it is a good idea. The only thing that is distracting is that the lights are way too bright.', '2005-09-15 20:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
