(1712544, 230796, 34547, '<td valign="top">I get the apathy part but what is your title trying to say? The Golden Arches indeed represent some problem with the world, are you saying something about this? What is the message?</td>', 'I get the apathy part but what is your title trying to say? The Golden Arches indeed represent some problem with the world, are you saying something about this? What is the message?', '2005-09-15 20:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
