(1712560, 229090, 42957, '<td valign="top">I like your title, but I don''t see much scurrying in the picture.  I like the colors and the detail of the wood bench.  But I feel like the person''s supposed to be the sharpest point.  Or maybe I''m just completely lacking in any artistic sense.  (The latter could very well be true).  xD</td>', 'I like your title, but I don''t see much scurrying in the picture.  I like the colors and the detail of the wood bench.  But I feel like the person''s supposed to be the sharpest point.  Or maybe I''m just completely lacking in any artistic sense.  (The latter could very well be true).  xD', '2005-09-15 20:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712562, 231169, 42957, '<td valign="top">I''d give a higher rating if the photo was more silvery and smooth, because it''s on the verge of being so, but not quite.</td>', 'I''d give a higher rating if the photo was more silvery and smooth, because it''s on the verge of being so, but not quite.', '2005-09-15 20:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712564, 230788, 42957, '<td valign="top">I had an idea somewhat like this....What IS that thing?  Anyway, I like the soft feel of the sky, but it doesn''t really fit with the...whatever it is.  I see some noise on the closest balck stripe, but it''s not too bad.</td>', 'I had an idea somewhat like this....What IS that thing?  Anyway, I like the soft feel of the sky, but it doesn''t really fit with the...whatever it is.  I see some noise on the closest balck stripe, but it''s not too bad.', '2005-09-15 20:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
