(1712569, 229726, 42957, '<td valign="top">That is quite an interesting helmet.  I think the helmet could be a little more sharp and the background a little more blurred.  And also I think you should move the helmet more to the side or something; I don''t really like things in the middle and there''s not exactly a distinguishable focal point.</td>', 'That is quite an interesting helmet.  I think the helmet could be a little more sharp and the background a little more blurred.  And also I think you should move the helmet more to the side or something; I don''t really like things in the middle and there''s not exactly a distinguishable focal point.', '2005-09-15 20:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712570, 230389, 40797, '<td valign="top">What wonderful perspective. I realy lilke everything about this image, It lifts my spirits.</td>', 'What wonderful perspective. I realy lilke everything about this image, It lifts my spirits.', '2005-09-15 20:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
