(1713020, 230978, 42957, '<td valign="top">I would like to see that brick thing in the lower left corner cropped out and a more distinctive focal point.</td>', 'I would like to see that brick thing in the lower left corner cropped out and a more distinctive focal point.', '2005-09-15 23:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
