(1713030, 231286, 34763, '<td valign="top">I was there last September, looks like not as much snow now. Great shot and if there was a 1000 foot long cruise ship up against it it would just be visible above the water level .</td>', 'I was there last September, looks like not as much snow now. Great shot and if there was a 1000 foot long cruise ship up against it it would just be visible above the water level .', '2005-09-16 00:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
