(1713372, 229595, 24495, '<td valign="top">Boot should have been a little larger, to fill the frame in width. Excellent expression though.</td>', 'Boot should have been a little larger, to fill the frame in width. Excellent expression though.', '2005-09-16 03:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1713373, 229090, 35545, '<td valign="top">This has the potential to be a good picture, but almost everything is out of focus.</td>', 'This has the potential to be a good picture, but almost everything is out of focus.', '2005-09-16 03:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1713378, 230716, 19831, '<td valign="top">Creative. Very cool use of perspective. The image seems just a little flat tonally. Maybe a tweaking of levels or brightness/contrast could enhance the presentation?</td>', 'Creative. Very cool use of perspective. The image seems just a little flat tonally. Maybe a tweaking of levels or brightness/contrast could enhance the presentation?', '2005-09-16 03:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1713381, 230572, 19831, '<td valign="top">A very cool subject. Focus and dof pretty good. The sky seems kind of washed out. I''m thinking that this subject matter has the potential for something more dynamic, especially for this challenge. Although this is fine compositionally, it does have the pov of just standing at the end of the row of bikes and taking the shot. This is the perspective that you would expect to see if walking by. Maybe something more dramatic from down low, or up high, something that one would not normally see, could improve the presentation of this shot.</td>', 'A very cool subject. Focus and dof pretty good. The sky seems kind of washed out. I''m thinking that this subject matter has the potential for something more dynamic, especially for this challenge. Although this is fine compositionally, it does have the pov of just standing at the end of the row of bikes and taking the shot. This is the perspective that you would expect to see if walking by. Maybe something more dramatic from down low, or up high, something that one would not normally see, could improve the presentation of this shot.', '2005-09-16 03:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1713385, 231274, 19831, '<td valign="top">Focus and exposure are really good here. This is a good use of perspective. I think this particular pov though seems a little busy for me, there is so much present to look at, and my eye is struggling, trying to find the main point.</td>', 'Focus and exposure are really good here. This is a good use of perspective. I think this particular pov though seems a little busy for me, there is so much present to look at, and my eye is struggling, trying to find the main point.', '2005-09-16 03:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1713389, 229595, 43918, '<td valign="top">Love the pic.... Great work.. Defiantly a winner in my book.</td>', 'Love the pic.... Great work.. Defiantly a winner in my book.', '2005-09-16 03:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1713390, 230239, 19831, '<td valign="top">I find this compositionally sound and a good use of perspective. However it seems to be lacking a little in the interest department. I think the stairs provide great leading lines, and this is a nice scene. Perhaps a person or object placed somewhere along the stairs could add a lot.</td>', 'I find this compositionally sound and a good use of perspective. However it seems to be lacking a little in the interest department. I think the stairs provide great leading lines, and this is a nice scene. Perhaps a person or object placed somewhere along the stairs could add a lot.', '2005-09-16 03:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1713395, 229381, 19831, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. The slight tilt, and the grain I think make the image work. The legs add context and add interest. It is kind of surreal and slightly unsettling, cool. Nice job.</td>', 'Interesting shot. The slight tilt, and the grain I think make the image work. The legs add context and add interest. It is kind of surreal and slightly unsettling, cool. Nice job.', '2005-09-16 03:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1713397, 230841, 19831, '<td valign="top">Strong composition. Nice execution of a classic concept. I like the play of shadow and light. Good job.</td>', 'Strong composition. Nice execution of a classic concept. I like the play of shadow and light. Good job.', '2005-09-16 03:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1713402, 229807, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool image. Very clear and great detail. I like your processing. The mountains are a great backdrop for this photo. Nice.</td>', 'Very cool image. Very clear and great detail. I like your processing. The mountains are a great backdrop for this photo. Nice.', '2005-09-16 03:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1713409, 231045, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool concept. Good use of perspective. I think maybe it could be a little stronger in this case without the slight blur, and maybe cropping a little bit closer to a centered composition (meaning the arch of the opening is further to the left, maybe crop off a little of the right so it is closer to center)</td>', 'Very cool concept. Good use of perspective. I think maybe it could be a little stronger in this case without the slight blur, and maybe cropping a little bit closer to a centered composition (meaning the arch of the opening is further to the left, maybe crop off a little of the right so it is closer to center)', '2005-09-16 03:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1713418, 229088, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. I think having the foreground cat in silhouette conveys the concept. I think the focus could be sharper though. And maybe a tighter framing could strengthen the presentation some. The background seems too busy and distracting, with the patterned multi colored blankets, and paneling. Keeping your composition simple, cleaner and non distracting will keep attention on your subject and help the image to have a higher interest level.</td>', 'Very cool idea. I think having the foreground cat in silhouette conveys the concept. I think the focus could be sharper though. And maybe a tighter framing could strengthen the presentation some. The background seems too busy and distracting, with the patterned multi colored blankets, and paneling. Keeping your composition simple, cleaner and non distracting will keep attention on your subject and help the image to have a higher interest level.', '2005-09-16 03:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1713422, 228469, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool image. I like the colors, and the building in the background.</td>', 'Cool image. I like the colors, and the building in the background.', '2005-09-16 03:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1713424, 231091, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool. The composition has good lines.</td>', 'Very cool. The composition has good lines.', '2005-09-16 03:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1713428, 229255, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. Nice composition. I like the shallow dof here, but I''m thinking maybe it is just a little bit too shallow. If there was still the blur, but a little more definition to the background tables, it might strengthen the presentation here.</td>', 'Very cool idea. Nice composition. I like the shallow dof here, but I''m thinking maybe it is just a little bit too shallow. If there was still the blur, but a little more definition to the background tables, it might strengthen the presentation here.', '2005-09-16 03:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
