(1713859, 230621, 27562, '<td valign="top">Nice tonality &amp; good perspective, but the dead space to the left of the keys distracts from an otherwise excellent image (crop to less pano?).  Good work.</td>', 'Nice tonality & good perspective, but the dead space to the left of the keys distracts from an otherwise excellent image (crop to less pano?).  Good work.', '2005-09-16 11:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
