(1713989, 229120, 40019, '<td valign="top">I love this picture!  Wish I could have found a stairwell like this.  B/W made the shot - great tone.</td>', 'I love this picture!  Wish I could have found a stairwell like this.  B/W made the shot - great tone.', '2005-09-16 12:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
