(1714850, 231247, 19116, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like a drawing.  It''s a neat effect, though some people might not care for it.  What kind of processing did you do on this?  Too bad it''s not a Sooners windmill...</td>', 'It almost looks like a drawing.  It''s a neat effect, though some people might not care for it.  What kind of processing did you do on this?  Too bad it''s not a Sooners windmill...', '2005-09-16 19:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
