(1715293, 231339, 36831, '<td valign="top">Not a reflectino on your photograph, but too bad the building pops out. It would have been awesome if the stairs had an unrestricted to the sky. Great photo, popping sky.</td>', 'Not a reflectino on your photograph, but too bad the building pops out. It would have been awesome if the stairs had an unrestricted to the sky. Great photo, popping sky.', '2005-09-16 21:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715297, 230861, 36831, '<td valign="top">Good setup but I would have preferred more contrast. The colors are a little muted and the sky is blown out (unless it was cloudy) Still a good pic. I like the row brings you to the cows.</td>', 'Good setup but I would have preferred more contrast. The colors are a little muted and the sky is blown out (unless it was cloudy) Still a good pic. I like the row brings you to the cows.', '2005-09-16 21:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
