(1715509, 229873, 40797, '<td valign="top">Yep, that is what this image is - A geometric mismatch. Nice clean image with lots of good perspective. Good Job!</td>', 'Yep, that is what this image is - A geometric mismatch. Nice clean image with lots of good perspective. Good Job!', '2005-09-16 23:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715516, 231009, 40797, '<td valign="top">Nice image with lots of good perspective.  I like the lines on the field  leading the eye to the vanishing point as well as the shadow of the goal post.  What a minuite, I am a soccer mom and should of thought of this!  Good job</td>', 'Nice image with lots of good perspective.  I like the lines on the field  leading the eye to the vanishing point as well as the shadow of the goal post.  What a minuite, I am a soccer mom and should of thought of this!  Good job', '2005-09-17 00:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715518, 231333, 24981, '<td valign="top">Nice pic. would like to see a bit more light on the black keys so I can tell where one ends and another begins.</td>', 'Nice pic. would like to see a bit more light on the black keys so I can tell where one ends and another begins.', '2005-09-17 00:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715528, 228900, 18191, '<td valign="top">Wow... yet another reason to go to Iceland ;)!</td>', 'Wow... yet another reason to go to Iceland ;)!', '2005-09-17 00:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715530, 229165, 39429, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  The tonality and contrast really work for it.  I think that compositionally, it would be stronger with the first section on the left cropped out.  It would still take it from large to small and would take the main curves out of the center. 6</td>', 'I like this shot.  The tonality and contrast really work for it.  I think that compositionally, it would be stronger with the first section on the left cropped out.  It would still take it from large to small and would take the main curves out of the center. 6', '2005-09-17 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715538, 230709, 39429, '<td valign="top">Overall, I like this.  I feel it could be even stronger with most of the furthest right pillar cropped out.  With the opening centered, the right side doesn''t have enough visual weight to balance the mass on the left. 6</td>', 'Overall, I like this.  I feel it could be even stronger with most of the furthest right pillar cropped out.  With the opening centered, the right side doesn''t have enough visual weight to balance the mass on the left. 6', '2005-09-17 00:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715549, 230908, 39429, '<td valign="top">Good coloring. Interesting building.  Technically, it could use a clearer focus.  Also, the composition could use a bit more sky on the top and since the picture is not symetrical, the left side could be cropped to place the windows on the 1/3 line.  5</td>', 'Good coloring. Interesting building.  Technically, it could use a clearer focus.  Also, the composition could use a bit more sky on the top and since the picture is not symetrical, the left side could be cropped to place the windows on the 1/3 line.  5', '2005-09-17 00:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715555, 230319, 39429, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful building and wonderful mood created by the lights.  The soft focus in the walls and ceilings works well for me, but does not work as well on the bench backs.  Still, a great feeling of serenity is created. 7</td>', 'Very beautiful building and wonderful mood created by the lights.  The soft focus in the walls and ceilings works well for me, but does not work as well on the bench backs.  Still, a great feeling of serenity is created. 7', '2005-09-17 00:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715570, 231169, 39429, '<td valign="top">Good overall.  As a comment to really help it pop, since this is intended to be a centered, symetrical image, getting the corner line exactly vertical and center could be the detail you need.  Then crop it so that it''s squared and even on both sides.  It''s close but not quite there.    The clouds add a nice mode to this shot. 6</td>', 'Good overall.  As a comment to really help it pop, since this is intended to be a centered, symetrical image, getting the corner line exactly vertical and center could be the detail you need.  Then crop it so that it''s squared and even on both sides.  It''s close but not quite there.    The clouds add a nice mode to this shot. 6', '2005-09-17 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715575, 230499, 39429, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting piece to capture.  Right now, my eye swings right off of the bench to the building in the back ground.  Since the main subject appears to be the bench, adjusting your focus and DOF so that the beginning to the center of the bench is in focus would strenghten the shot.  5</td>', 'This is an interesting piece to capture.  Right now, my eye swings right off of the bench to the building in the back ground.  Since the main subject appears to be the bench, adjusting your focus and DOF so that the beginning to the center of the bench is in focus would strenghten the shot.  5', '2005-09-17 00:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715584, 231246, 39429, '<td valign="top">While the colors and lines initially catch my attention, the image does not keep it.  The focus is not crisp enough to keep the perspective lines prominant.  The bench reflection is not strong enough to add, but instead provides a distraction.  I do feel the angle of the photo works well for you. 4</td>', 'While the colors and lines initially catch my attention, the image does not keep it.  The focus is not crisp enough to keep the perspective lines prominant.  The bench reflection is not strong enough to add, but instead provides a distraction.  I do feel the angle of the photo works well for you. 4', '2005-09-17 00:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715588, 231293, 24981, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Would love to see a color version after the challenge is over.</td>', 'Nice shot. Would love to see a color version after the challenge is over.', '2005-09-17 00:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715594, 231247, 39429, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  Technically, the diagonal lines are showing up "jagged"  This could be because of the method used to reduce the image to the 640 pixels, a compression problem in your camera, or sharpening before you reduced the size of your image, instead of after.  5</td>', 'Interesting image.  Technically, the diagonal lines are showing up "jagged"  This could be because of the method used to reduce the image to the 640 pixels, a compression problem in your camera, or sharpening before you reduced the size of your image, instead of after.  5', '2005-09-17 00:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
