(1715922, 229101, 7560, '<td valign="top">Very cool concept here. It would be greatly aided by having a more controled background for the reflection. I''d strongly consider revisiting this shot and working with different types of backgrounds. Really cool idea.</td>', 'Very cool concept here. It would be greatly aided by having a more controled background for the reflection. I''d strongly consider revisiting this shot and working with different types of backgrounds. Really cool idea.', '2005-09-17 07:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715924, 229778, 7560, '<td valign="top">I really like this iidea a good bit. The chief issue I have with the image is the bokeh, or lack there of. Because of the depth of field decision made by you (or the camera) the background of leaves stands out too much. It does not look visually appealing. I''d suggest either using a shallower apature setting if you are shooting with a dSLR, or using the macro  or flower mode on your digital point and shoot. Great idea though!</td>', 'I really like this iidea a good bit. The chief issue I have with the image is the bokeh, or lack there of. Because of the depth of field decision made by you (or the camera) the background of leaves stands out too much. It does not look visually appealing. I''d suggest either using a shallower apature setting if you are shooting with a dSLR, or using the macro  or flower mode on your digital point and shoot. Great idea though!', '2005-09-17 08:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715928, 230949, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. I have a similar shot staged in my head that I really want to try, I just don''t have all the props I need yet.  I would have possibly adjusted the angles a bit so you can''t see the edge of the map, but otherwise solid.</td>', 'I love this shot. I have a similar shot staged in my head that I really want to try, I just don''t have all the props I need yet.  I would have possibly adjusted the angles a bit so you can''t see the edge of the map, but otherwise solid.', '2005-09-17 08:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
