(1716407, 228883, 43565, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but I would like to see something a little more interesting through the eye.</td>', 'Great idea, but I would like to see something a little more interesting through the eye.', '2005-09-17 14:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716411, 230127, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better from a different angle so that more of the nets could be seen and it wouldn''t just be a line down the center.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better from a different angle so that more of the nets could be seen and it wouldn''t just be a line down the center.', '2005-09-17 15:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716412, 230958, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would prefer a straight horizon line</td>', 'I would prefer a straight horizon line', '2005-09-17 15:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716419, 231368, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would like this better cropped closer to where the strings start (don''t know what that is called!)</td>', 'I would like this better cropped closer to where the strings start (don''t know what that is called!)', '2005-09-17 15:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716420, 229255, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think the tables should be angled across the picture instead of going straight down the center. I also don''t like the glare on the glass</td>', 'I think the tables should be angled across the picture instead of going straight down the center. I also don''t like the glare on the glass', '2005-09-17 15:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716428, 231005, 35545, '<td valign="top">Tones, opposing planes, lines, mood.  This has it all.  I love it!</td>', 'Tones, opposing planes, lines, mood.  This has it all.  I love it!', '2005-09-17 15:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716433, 231002, 35545, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  The only ting I *might* change is the portion above the last ine of roofs.  It''s so much lighter than the foreground that it almost looks like two pictures.  This is my opinion, and it''s worth exactly what you''re paying for it.</td>', 'I love this picture.  The only ting I *might* change is the portion above the last ine of roofs.  It''s so much lighter than the foreground that it almost looks like two pictures.  This is my opinion, and it''s worth exactly what you''re paying for it.', '2005-09-17 15:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716434, 228874, 35545, '<td valign="top">Esta no Brasil?  O foto da para matar saudades.  Otima.</td>', 'Esta no Brasil?  O foto da para matar saudades.  Otima.', '2005-09-17 15:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716484, 229348, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nicely balanced. Interesting textures and reflections.</td>', 'Good composition, nicely balanced. Interesting textures and reflections.', '2005-09-17 15:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716491, 229689, 35804, '<td valign="top">Beautiful B &amp; W!</td>', 'Beautiful B & W!', '2005-09-17 16:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716498, 228885, 35804, '<td valign="top">Goodness knows my jar''s mashed all the back in my fridge...what a fun idea!...life through the eyes of a pickle...wonder how this image is doing...if people are "getting" it.</td>', 'Goodness knows my jar''s mashed all the back in my fridge...what a fun idea!...life through the eyes of a pickle...wonder how this image is doing...if people are "getting" it.', '2005-09-17 16:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716500, 231012, 42336, '<td valign="top">I would love to hear how you did this picture. I tried a ton of things but I couldn''t get it without the reflection.</td>', 'I would love to hear how you did this picture. I tried a ton of things but I couldn''t get it without the reflection.', '2005-09-17 16:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716502, 228928, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like this...to me this is a bit different than the usual sunset image..perhaps it''s the "nearness" of the grass/grain that makes all the difference...I think that must be it...a more intimate sunset of sorts...I feel as though I am there...very nice.</td>', 'I really like this...to me this is a bit different than the usual sunset image..perhaps it''s the "nearness" of the grass/grain that makes all the difference...I think that must be it...a more intimate sunset of sorts...I feel as though I am there...very nice.', '2005-09-17 16:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716503, 229531, 35804, '<td valign="top">Pretty reds....very "luminous"...I do wish autumn would get here...</td>', 'Pretty reds....very "luminous"...I do wish autumn would get here...', '2005-09-17 16:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716505, 230841, 35804, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic "light", quite proper for what is being said...a powerful image.</td>', 'Very dramatic "light", quite proper for what is being said...a powerful image.', '2005-09-17 16:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716507, 230813, 35804, '<td valign="top">Love the light and color in this one...this is almost entrancing...very nice.</td>', 'Love the light and color in this one...this is almost entrancing...very nice.', '2005-09-17 16:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716510, 229628, 40922, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far in this challenge. Niceely shows perspective with a unique subject. Well composed - nice light.</td>', 'My favorite so far in this challenge. Niceely shows perspective with a unique subject. Well composed - nice light.', '2005-09-17 16:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716513, 229500, 35804, '<td valign="top">I do like the color in this image, the tilt seems to be a bit much, maybe if the image were situated at "potrait"dimensions instead of "landscape"...the tilt may work a little better?(jmo)...and there seems to be some little sensor ghosties here and there...even still...I do love the color...the reds are fantastic!</td>', 'I do like the color in this image, the tilt seems to be a bit much, maybe if the image were situated at "potrait"dimensions instead of "landscape"...the tilt may work a little better?(jmo)...and there seems to be some little sensor ghosties here and there...even still...I do love the color...the reds are fantastic!', '2005-09-17 16:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716521, 231233, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this does not create a dramatic perspective as described in the challenge, and the subject does not hold my interest.</td>', 'For me, this does not create a dramatic perspective as described in the challenge, and the subject does not hold my interest.', '2005-09-17 16:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716523, 231000, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting notion...from a dead bug perspective (at least that''s my interpretation).</td>', 'Interesting notion...from a dead bug perspective (at least that''s my interpretation).', '2005-09-17 16:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716524, 231089, 43956, '<td valign="top">I like this a LOT.</td>', 'I like this a LOT.', '2005-09-17 16:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716525, 231197, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this reminds me of someone looking into a web cam. There is some perspective, but again for me, does not have dramatic effect compared to many others in this challenge.</td>', 'For me, this reminds me of someone looking into a web cam. There is some perspective, but again for me, does not have dramatic effect compared to many others in this challenge.', '2005-09-17 16:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716529, 230986, 41675, '<td valign="top">Compared to others in this challenge, the subject matter doesn''t hold my attention, and I''m not crazy about the over use of coloring in a photo editing program.</td>', 'Compared to others in this challenge, the subject matter doesn''t hold my attention, and I''m not crazy about the over use of coloring in a photo editing program.', '2005-09-17 16:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716530, 231355, 35804, '<td valign="top">Whoa...you''ve stopped me in my tracks! For a minute this reminded me of one of those medical films of our insides, while alive of course, you know like "The life of a fallopian tube"...something like that. There is just something so "alive" about this..so "fleshy", it didn''t "register" as a flower at first ...and the light is gorgeous...very nicely done.</td>', 'Whoa...you''ve stopped me in my tracks! For a minute this reminded me of one of those medical films of our insides, while alive of course, you know like "The life of a fallopian tube"...something like that. There is just something so "alive" about this..so "fleshy", it didn''t "register" as a flower at first ...and the light is gorgeous...very nicely done.', '2005-09-17 16:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716531, 230403, 41675, '<td valign="top">I think the overall lack of focus is distracting, but I like the perspective you tried to achieve.</td>', 'I think the overall lack of focus is distracting, but I like the perspective you tried to achieve.', '2005-09-17 16:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716532, 230274, 41675, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit harsh and I wish the puck itself were more in focus. Interesting point of view though - shows creativity.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit harsh and I wish the puck itself were more in focus. Interesting point of view though - shows creativity.', '2005-09-17 16:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716535, 231262, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this does not create a "dramatic effect" as stated in the challenge, but reminds me of a want ad.</td>', 'For me, this does not create a "dramatic effect" as stated in the challenge, but reminds me of a want ad.', '2005-09-17 16:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716536, 231120, 41675, '<td valign="top">While not a bad concept, for me, it does not create a dramatic perspective effect compared to others in the challenge.</td>', 'While not a bad concept, for me, it does not create a dramatic perspective effect compared to others in the challenge.', '2005-09-17 16:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
