(1716538, 228641, 41675, '<td valign="top">While there is some perspective, I don''t find it as dramatic as other photos in this challenge. I like the lighting though.</td>', 'While there is some perspective, I don''t find it as dramatic as other photos in this challenge. I like the lighting though.', '2005-09-17 16:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
