(1716903, 231161, 15711, '<td valign="top">The is tack sharp and the contrast is perfect.  It is so simple and VERY effective.  I like it alot.</td>', 'The is tack sharp and the contrast is perfect.  It is so simple and VERY effective.  I like it alot.', '2005-09-17 22:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716904, 230765, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really clever.  I love the hand - great idea.  The title is perfect. I''m a big fan of one word titles.  I like the brown tones of it as well. 8</td>', 'Really clever.  I love the hand - great idea.  The title is perfect. I''m a big fan of one word titles.  I like the brown tones of it as well. 8', '2005-09-17 22:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716906, 230847, 15711, '<td valign="top">The clarity of this is amazing.  Great warm hues. Architectural shots like these can be a dime a dozen, but your choice of the lion heads really puts some pizazz to it. I feel almost like they are singing! Reminds me of a choir on the risers about to let out that first note!! The lighting and shadows work so well in this shot.</td>', 'The clarity of this is amazing.  Great warm hues. Architectural shots like these can be a dime a dozen, but your choice of the lion heads really puts some pizazz to it. I feel almost like they are singing! Reminds me of a choir on the risers about to let out that first note!! The lighting and shadows work so well in this shot.', '2005-09-17 22:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716909, 228954, 15711, '<td valign="top">The cool blues and lavenders are wonderful compliments to each other. I like that single tiny beacon of light from the lighthouse.  The rocks are great contrast to the smooth movement of the water.  Really well done.</td>', 'The cool blues and lavenders are wonderful compliments to each other. I like that single tiny beacon of light from the lighthouse.  The rocks are great contrast to the smooth movement of the water.  Really well done.', '2005-09-17 22:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716910, 230822, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good colour range and sharpness.  I like the perspective and the balance in the composition.</td>', 'Good colour range and sharpness.  I like the perspective and the balance in the composition.', '2005-09-17 22:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716912, 229467, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very dynamic composition.</td>', 'Very dynamic composition.', '2005-09-17 22:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716913, 231356, 24642, '<td valign="top">Great.</td>', 'Great.', '2005-09-17 22:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716914, 231280, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  I like the skin tones and the beautiful eyes.  Nice lighting and composition as well. ;~D</td>', 'Very cute.  I like the skin tones and the beautiful eyes.  Nice lighting and composition as well. ;~D', '2005-09-17 22:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716915, 229331, 24642, '<td valign="top">A very witty idea.</td>', 'A very witty idea.', '2005-09-17 22:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716917, 230658, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very slick, nice b/w work and a brilliant perspective.</td>', 'Very slick, nice b/w work and a brilliant perspective.', '2005-09-17 22:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716920, 231035, 24642, '<td valign="top">Rush and roar.</td>', 'Rush and roar.', '2005-09-17 22:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716924, 231342, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nicely balanced abstraction.</td>', 'Nicely balanced abstraction.', '2005-09-17 22:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716926, 230793, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  I like the sci-fi feel of this one.</td>', 'Very clever.  I like the sci-fi feel of this one.', '2005-09-17 22:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716932, 229360, 24642, '<td valign="top">A rare blend of interesting perspective, blur and texture.  Good work.</td>', 'A rare blend of interesting perspective, blur and texture.  Good work.', '2005-09-17 22:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716986, 230813, 41675, '<td valign="top">To me there is some sense of perspective, but I find all the people (tourists?) distracting and not really adding to the impace of the photo...ofcourse I could be missing th epoint you are trying to make with this photo. :)</td>', 'To me there is some sense of perspective, but I find all the people (tourists?) distracting and not really adding to the impace of the photo...ofcourse I could be missing th epoint you are trying to make with this photo. :)', '2005-09-17 22:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716987, 230141, 41675, '<td valign="top">Ugh! driver''s perspective indeed....at least you weren''t on the other side? Tee hee.</td>', 'Ugh! driver''s perspective indeed....at least you weren''t on the other side? Tee hee.', '2005-09-17 22:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716990, 228898, 41675, '<td valign="top">Personally, I''m not a fan of grainy shots, but you have captured perspective.</td>', 'Personally, I''m not a fan of grainy shots, but you have captured perspective.', '2005-09-17 23:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716993, 230621, 41675, '<td valign="top">Compared to the other piano shots in this challenge, this is better.  I wish the focus extended down another key or two or that more of the keys were showing. Nice highlights on the two foreground keys.</td>', 'Compared to the other piano shots in this challenge, this is better.  I wish the focus extended down another key or two or that more of the keys were showing. Nice highlights on the two foreground keys.', '2005-09-17 23:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716996, 231273, 41675, '<td valign="top">If the path was a bit more defined, leading my eye somewhere, I would score it differently. Looks like a nice place for a walk though. :)</td>', 'If the path was a bit more defined, leading my eye somewhere, I would score it differently. Looks like a nice place for a walk though. :)', '2005-09-17 23:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716999, 229678, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the out of focus area is too large in the foreground. My eyes are "blocked" by this and I don''t really look at the rest of the photo. Good idea however.</td>', 'For me, the out of focus area is too large in the foreground. My eyes are "blocked" by this and I don''t really look at the rest of the photo. Good idea however.', '2005-09-17 23:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717005, 231060, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, there is some perspective, but not as much as other photos in the challenge. My eyes are drawn to the orange light left of center and don''t see much else in the picture.</td>', 'For me, there is some perspective, but not as much as other photos in the challenge. My eyes are drawn to the orange light left of center and don''t see much else in the picture.', '2005-09-17 23:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717010, 229385, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cute kids. I wish the other boy had been looking into the camera as well. I think this photo works well as a black and white.</td>', 'Cute kids. I wish the other boy had been looking into the camera as well. I think this photo works well as a black and white.', '2005-09-17 23:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717014, 230295, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish the subject wasn''t dead center as I think there is more interest in a photo when objects are off-centered. My eyes follow the curve of the sign to the overhead wires and then I look off to the edge of the photo and don''t really look at the right hand side of the picture.</td>', 'For me, I wish the subject wasn''t dead center as I think there is more interest in a photo when objects are off-centered. My eyes follow the curve of the sign to the overhead wires and then I look off to the edge of the photo and don''t really look at the right hand side of the picture.', '2005-09-17 23:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717018, 230592, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good self portrait(?) The tonal values you chose work good. I''m so used to looking at buildings in this challenge that quite frankly, I''m not sure how to score a self-perspective...hmmmm</td>', 'Good self portrait(?) The tonal values you chose work good. I''m so used to looking at buildings in this challenge that quite frankly, I''m not sure how to score a self-perspective...hmmmm', '2005-09-17 23:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717020, 229968, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this photo would have greater interest and impace if the refelctions at the very top were cropped out. The photo itself appears grainy and out of focus on my monitor, but a good idea.</td>', 'For me, this photo would have greater interest and impace if the refelctions at the very top were cropped out. The photo itself appears grainy and out of focus on my monitor, but a good idea.', '2005-09-17 23:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717023, 228908, 41675, '<td valign="top">I read your title of "wash me", but the object of your photo appears to be clean. Maybe it''s all in the perspective? :|</td>', 'I read your title of "wash me", but the object of your photo appears to be clean. Maybe it''s all in the perspective? :|', '2005-09-17 23:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717025, 229778, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of the way the chess pieces are lined up. I''m not good at technical critiquing, but there''s something about the overall greenish tint to the board itself I''m not crazy about.</td>', 'I like the concept of the way the chess pieces are lined up. I''m not good at technical critiquing, but there''s something about the overall greenish tint to the board itself I''m not crazy about.', '2005-09-17 23:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717028, 230674, 41675, '<td valign="top">for me, I would have liked to have seen the foreground flower completely cropped out and cropped in from the left side as well. Perhaps a bit more in focus too. I like the white border and concept - shows creativity.</td>', 'for me, I would have liked to have seen the foreground flower completely cropped out and cropped in from the left side as well. Perhaps a bit more in focus too. I like the white border and concept - shows creativity.', '2005-09-17 23:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717029, 231368, 41675, '<td valign="top">When I first look at this photo, all I notice is the overwhelming highlight in the foreground and I have to "push" my eyes past that to look at the rest of the image. I do like the angle you chose.</td>', 'When I first look at this photo, all I notice is the overwhelming highlight in the foreground and I have to "push" my eyes past that to look at the rest of the image. I do like the angle you chose.', '2005-09-17 23:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717031, 231318, 39429, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry.  I''m missing out on what this really is.  I can see the shooting fountains, the boy, the hot dog stand, water reflections and a black and yellow striped something.  I can''t figure it out.  4</td>', 'I''m sorry.  I''m missing out on what this really is.  I can see the shooting fountains, the boy, the hot dog stand, water reflections and a black and yellow striped something.  I can''t figure it out.  4', '2005-09-17 23:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717032, 231151, 41675, '<td valign="top">Don''t you just hate it when you open a new bag and there''s only about 1/3rd content and the rest was just packaged air? Different take on the challenge - shows creativity...or you were hungry and your camera was nearby :-)</td>', 'Don''t you just hate it when you open a new bag and there''s only about 1/3rd content and the rest was just packaged air? Different take on the challenge - shows creativity...or you were hungry and your camera was nearby :-)', '2005-09-17 23:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
