(1718882, 228757, 42984, '<td valign="top">The framing, the subject, the sunset and the perspective - you got them all in this shot. I''ve had to deduct a point because it hasn''t been squared up.  This is a tough competition and the attention to detail counts. I appreciate that if you don''t have the software to rotate, that it is very dificult to get it right in camera</td>', 'The framing, the subject, the sunset and the perspective - you got them all in this shot. I''ve had to deduct a point because it hasn''t been squared up.  This is a tough competition and the attention to detail counts. I appreciate that if you don''t have the software to rotate, that it is very dificult to get it right in camera', '2005-09-18 16:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
