(1721556, 230764, 19670, '<td valign="top">Nice rotation! Two aspects of perspective seen here--the receding apartments, and the idea of looking at the buiding from a different view (I also presented my shot at a different orientation than the subject actually is). From the thumbnail, I first thought these were mailboxes, then storage units. Has a futuristic look and feel.</td>', 'Nice rotation! Two aspects of perspective seen here--the receding apartments, and the idea of looking at the buiding from a different view (I also presented my shot at a different orientation than the subject actually is). From the thumbnail, I first thought these were mailboxes, then storage units. Has a futuristic look and feel.', '2005-09-19 17:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
