(1721580, 230445, 35804, '<td valign="top">I must honestly say everytime I see another one of these "suicide" images I ask myself "why?"...they''re all vaguely unsettling but bordering on cliche and trite...an easy "shock" if you will...at least you didn''t depict someone who has blown their head off...like my cousin did...<br/> <br/>I just wish people would think before entering an image like this...you are entitled to enter what you wish...it''s just that everytime I see another "tragic suicide" picture...I roll my eyes and thoughts of my cousin enter my mind, a sadness I''m not fond of revisiting...thanks.</td>', 'I must honestly say everytime I see another one of these "suicide" images I ask myself "why?"...they''re all vaguely unsettling but bordering on cliche and trite...an easy "shock" if you will...at least you didn''t depict someone who has blown their head off...like my cousin did... I just wish people would think before entering an image like this...you are entitled to enter what you wish...it''s just that everytime I see another "tragic suicide" picture...I roll my eyes and thoughts of my cousin enter my mind, a sadness I''m not fond of revisiting...thanks.', '2005-09-19 17:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
