(1722858, 230319, 43431, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, but would like to see the pews cropped the same on each side.  Probably standing further to the left would do the trick.</td>', 'I really like this photo, but would like to see the pews cropped the same on each side.  Probably standing further to the left would do the trick.', '2005-09-20 00:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
