(1722872, 230797, 36597, '<td valign="top">I really like how you blured the hand... it adds depth to a short distance... cool.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'I really like how you blured the hand... it adds depth to a short distance... cool.Good luck!', '2005-09-20 00:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
