(1723775, 231351, 4477, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful b&amp;w landscape.  I like the darker sky in the top corners and the light coming down from the clouds.  Perfect title too.  A favorite of mine now.  :-)</td>', 'A very beautiful b&w landscape.  I like the darker sky in the top corners and the light coming down from the clouds.  Perfect title too.  A favorite of mine now.  :-)', '2005-09-20 11:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
