(1723966, 229467, 36621, '<td valign="top">Too bad so much detail is lost due to lighting since this is a great image based upon subject and composition.</td>', 'Too bad so much detail is lost due to lighting since this is a great image based upon subject and composition.', '2005-09-20 12:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
