(1725377, 229779, 39664, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful peeping Tom shot!  I don''t understand the title and how this is a perspective shot.  The photo itself is really beautiful!<br/> <br/>edit: Oh I see, after the book "The Little Match Girl" as in she is outside looking in.  Nice take on the classic literature.  It might have been more effective if the people inside were dressed more festive and for colder weather.  I gave this a 7 now I am bumping up to an 8.  Good job!  :-)</td>', 'What a wonderful peeping Tom shot!  I don''t understand the title and how this is a perspective shot.  The photo itself is really beautiful! edit: Oh I see, after the book "The Little Match Girl" as in she is outside looking in.  Nice take on the classic literature.  It might have been more effective if the people inside were dressed more festive and for colder weather.  I gave this a 7 now I am bumping up to an 8.  Good job!  :-)', '2005-09-20 22:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
