(1725433, 231354, 14736, '<td valign="top">I like the colors for the graphiti and rust, but the water is too extreme for me.  I would selectively turn down the blue on the water to give it a more natural look.  Conversely, many people like that look, in which case you don''t need to make any changes.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like the colors for the graphiti and rust, but the water is too extreme for me.  I would selectively turn down the blue on the water to give it a more natural look.  Conversely, many people like that look, in which case you don''t need to make any changes.  Good luck!', '2005-09-20 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
