(1726029, 230869, 42277, '<td valign="top">Edit - dpc farted and triple posted my post<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-21 01:35:52.</i></td>', 'Edit - dpc farted and triple posted my post', '2005-09-21 02:16:53.000000', '2005-09-21 02:35:52.000000', 0),
(1726033, 230869, 42277, '<td valign="top">Edit - dpc farted and triple posted my post<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-21 01:36:27.</i></td>', 'Edit - dpc farted and triple posted my post', '2005-09-21 02:23:40.000000', '2005-09-21 02:36:27.000000', 0),
(1726038, 230869, 42277, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ktm7:</b></div><hr/><i> this photos alright. i think there are more creative ways to take photos of perspective. nice try though. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, unfortunately, I discovered after I had entered that "perspective" has a definate and defined term in photography, different to "Point of View".  <br/> <br/>Ah well, it was my first ever entry, so if I''m going to make mistakes, that''s the time to do it :)</td>', 'Originally posted by ktm7: this photos alright. i think there are more creative ways to take photos of perspective. nice try though.   Yes, unfortunately, I discovered after I had entered that "perspective" has a definate and defined term in photography, different to "Point of View".   Ah well, it was my first ever entry, so if I''m going to make mistakes, that''s the time to do it :)', '2005-09-21 02:29:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1726048, 229120, 30364, '<td valign="top">Oh no, not you again?  That''s twice in a month, Chris.  Voters here must be doing an awful lot of late night drinking.  <br/>It''s brilliant.  Truly one of the best images on the site, and a great addition to your portfolio.  It''s also a welcome relief (and surprise) to see such a cerebral work score so well.  I didn''t comment during voting because I didn''t vote, or even look. 536 entries!<br/>The composition is terrific ... hints of MC Escher, but with a whiff of zen!  The white fish is a master stroke ... how you got the little bugger to hold perfect position right there is beyond me.  Nails?    <br/>Probably the most impressive aspect is the crop ... I know that awesome little lens screwed down to 10mm made it possible, but the crop is nevertheless absolutely audacious and a great tribute to your vision.  There!  Enough sycophancy ... I''m off for a late night drink. <br/></td>', 'Oh no, not you again?  That''s twice in a month, Chris.  Voters here must be doing an awful lot of late night drinking.  It''s brilliant.  Truly one of the best images on the site, and a great addition to your portfolio.  It''s also a welcome relief (and surprise) to see such a cerebral work score so well.  I didn''t comment during voting because I didn''t vote, or even look. 536 entries!The composition is terrific ... hints of MC Escher, but with a whiff of zen!  The white fish is a master stroke ... how you got the little bugger to hold perfect position right there is beyond me.  Nails?    Probably the most impressive aspect is the crop ... I know that awesome little lens screwed down to 10mm made it possible, but the crop is nevertheless absolutely audacious and a great tribute to your vision.  There!  Enough sycophancy ... I''m off for a late night drink. ', '2005-09-21 02:39:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1726049, 230418, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Congratulations!  A blue after only 4 challenges!</td>', 'Great shot.  Congratulations!  A blue after only 4 challenges!', '2005-09-21 02:53:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1726052, 230127, 3554, '<td valign="top">Hey you made it over 5 for your first challenge, not too shabby. I still like it centered, even though others didn''t.  But it would be cool to try some of the suggestions made here and post them in your gallery. <br/> <br/>And see I TOLD you it was Tubaman no 10 involved.  :)</td>', 'Hey you made it over 5 for your first challenge, not too shabby. I still like it centered, even though others didn''t.  But it would be cool to try some of the suggestions made here and post them in your gallery.  And see I TOLD you it was Tubaman no 10 involved.  :)', '2005-09-21 02:56:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1726062, 230912, 44453, '<td valign="top">Glebe Island Bridge I assume? Very nice</td>', 'Glebe Island Bridge I assume? Very nice', '2005-09-21 03:04:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1726086, 230418, 42374, '<td valign="top">I thought it was my best photo but this is almost too much. Thank you!<br/> <br/><a href="//miisami.net/TouchingTheSurfaceOfTheNaturalMirror.php" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The original photo with details</a> <br/> <br/>More my photos at<br/><a href="//miisami.net" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//miisami.net</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-21 04:45:00.</i></td>', 'I thought it was my best photo but this is almost too much. Thank you! The original photo with details  More my photos at//miisami.net', '2005-09-21 03:22:56.000000', '2005-09-21 05:45:00.000000', 0),
(1726117, 228862, 93, '<td valign="top">Hey.. I''m going to start losing my top spots for the lens if you keep improving this quickly :)  Great shot.. you were really robbed.</td>', 'Hey.. I''m going to start losing my top spots for the lens if you keep improving this quickly :)  Great shot.. you were really robbed.', '2005-09-21 03:48:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1726127, 229120, 13749, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Okay, first of all - WOW at the photograph.  Amazing shot - great contrast, great tones, great lines, and.. dare I say it? - Great perspective.<br/> <br/>Second of all - wow at all those duplicate comments!</td>', 'Wow!  Okay, first of all - WOW at the photograph.  Amazing shot - great contrast, great tones, great lines, and.. dare I say it? - Great perspective. Second of all - wow at all those duplicate comments!', '2005-09-21 04:06:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1726131, 230418, 42985, '<td valign="top">Brilliant, if it could have been taken in your bath it is so calm.<br/>The softness makes it even better.</td>', 'Brilliant, if it could have been taken in your bath it is so calm.The softness makes it even better.', '2005-09-21 04:20:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1726145, 230851, 41548, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your kind commends. It''s surely a surprise for me to climb with this image in top 30.</td>', 'Thank you all for your kind commends. It''s surely a surprise for me to climb with this image in top 30.', '2005-09-21 05:30:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1726158, 229120, 30364, '<td valign="top">Hey Chris - sorry for all the bizarre duplications ... I''d been trying unsuccessfully to post when the site was acting up, and didn''t realise all my attempts were being queued up like that.  Hopefully someone (D&amp;L?) might rescue me &amp; delete all the superfluous edited posts below.  P.</td>', 'Hey Chris - sorry for all the bizarre duplications ... I''d been trying unsuccessfully to post when the site was acting up, and didn''t realise all my attempts were being queued up like that.  Hopefully someone (D&L?) might rescue me & delete all the superfluous edited posts below.  P.', '2005-09-21 06:12:54.000000', NULL, 0),
