(1726290, 228980, 38760, '<td valign="top">Yay! 48! Yes I agree that the sky is quite white, but it was taken with a little point and shoot that had nearly no manual controls, so it was kind of hard, and it isnt like I really had time to bracket my exposures. I actually got on the ride one time after this to try the shot again and they stopped the ride on the lift hill and sent someone walking up the stairs to grab my camera, I guess I didnt have it hidden enough, it was quite embarassing.</td>', 'Yay! 48! Yes I agree that the sky is quite white, but it was taken with a little point and shoot that had nearly no manual controls, so it was kind of hard, and it isnt like I really had time to bracket my exposures. I actually got on the ride one time after this to try the shot again and they stopped the ride on the lift hill and sent someone walking up the stairs to grab my camera, I guess I didnt have it hidden enough, it was quite embarassing.', '2005-09-21 07:43:18.000000', NULL, 0),
