(1727059, 229628, 30214, '<td valign="top">Great shot Brad! Congrats!<br/>I had a feeling that I''ve seen this row before but wasn''t sure. Now I am.   If I remember correctly, this street is called Hope Str, right? I took a similar photo some years ago in my film days with this row of boxes and the street sign above.<br/> <br/>Edit: Darn, just read your comments - it is Hope str, of course, and your Serendipity entry (which I hadn''t seen before) is almost identical to that photo of mine which I mentioned above.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-21 11:36:16.</i></td>', 'Great shot Brad! Congrats!I had a feeling that I''ve seen this row before but wasn''t sure. Now I am.   If I remember correctly, this street is called Hope Str, right? I took a similar photo some years ago in my film days with this row of boxes and the street sign above. Edit: Darn, just read your comments - it is Hope str, of course, and your Serendipity entry (which I hadn''t seen before) is almost identical to that photo of mine which I mentioned above.', '2005-09-21 12:32:48.000000', '2005-09-21 12:36:16.000000', 0),
