(1729901, 230541, 19959, '<td valign="top">This is really good... congratulations on your 5th place. This shot reminds me of my ''live music'' entry<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=217170" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/369/thumb/217170.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/369/thumb/217170.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/369/thumb/217170.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Excellent work, I had lighting issues also! :-)<br/> <br/>Chris</td>', 'This is really good... congratulations on your 5th place. This shot reminds me of my ''live music'' entry   Excellent work, I had lighting issues also! :-) Chris', '2005-09-22 06:49:08.000000', NULL, 0),
