(2618587, 230883, 20530, '<td valign="top">Incredible use of perspective. Lovely tones and  contrast and great detail. This image invokes a feeling of serentity and contemplation. It''s almost "Zenlike". Nice work.</td>', 'Incredible use of perspective. Lovely tones and  contrast and great detail. This image invokes a feeling of serentity and contemplation. It''s almost "Zenlike". Nice work.', '2006-07-13 11:52:26.000000', NULL, 0),
