(2687501, 230893, 12611, '<td valign="top">Fog is a great photographic technique; I love the platform/dock and the railing. such great perspective. This looks just like the view off the docks here is lake-heavy Connecticut, USA. <br/> <br/>Perhaps the composition would be improved by cropping out the reflecive bright green tree on the left- or perhaps cloning it out. Nice shot though.</td>', 'Fog is a great photographic technique; I love the platform/dock and the railing. such great perspective. This looks just like the view off the docks here is lake-heavy Connecticut, USA.  Perhaps the composition would be improved by cropping out the reflecive bright green tree on the left- or perhaps cloning it out. Nice shot though.', '2006-08-02 08:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2800143, 229322, 3214, '<td valign="top">I like this, although it is not well suited to a moment''s examination, probably why it was scored so low.</td>', 'I like this, although it is not well suited to a moment''s examination, probably why it was scored so low.', '2006-09-05 11:19:23.000000', NULL, 0),
