(2942196, 231351, 19708, '<td valign="top">This is a true definition of a dramatic image.<br/>Yes, there are a few "things" like halos and sensor spots, but I have come to overlook much of it as it is what we face in small, low-resolution digital imaging and basic editing.<br/>This is truly a stunning photograph!</td>', 'This is a true definition of a dramatic image.Yes, there are a few "things" like halos and sensor spots, but I have come to overlook much of it as it is what we face in small, low-resolution digital imaging and basic editing.This is truly a stunning photograph!', '2006-10-18 22:42:56.000000', NULL, 0),
