(4735748, 231351, 20506, '<td valign="top">Oooh what a beautiful picture. I often will look at the sky and see the light and clouds causing the most heavenly scenes and I think "I wish I could photograph that" at the time. You have here scenes like this remind me how very insignificant we are in this very big world. The nurting and love the heavens are giving these plants combined with your title really make the shot for me. Well done.</td>', 'Oooh what a beautiful picture. I often will look at the sky and see the light and clouds causing the most heavenly scenes and I think "I wish I could photograph that" at the time. You have here scenes like this remind me how very insignificant we are in this very big world. The nurting and love the heavens are giving these plants combined with your title really make the shot for me. Well done.', '2008-05-31 03:00:45.000000', NULL, 0),
